Package: earthUI
Title: Interactive 'shiny' GUIs for 'earth' (MARS) with 'glmnet' and
    'mgcv' Post Processing Modules
Version: 0.11.0
Authors@R:
    person("William", "Craytor", , "bcraytor@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides 'shiny'-based graphical user interfaces for building
    and exploring Multivariate Adaptive Regression Splines (MARS) models with
    the 'earth' package, plus two Post Processing Modules that corroborate the
    earth model: an elastic net application ('glmnet') that re-estimates the
    earth basis under regularization, and a generalized additive model
    application ('mgcv') seeded from the earth model's knots. The three
    routines share one project system and settings database. Features include
    data import from CSV and 'Excel' files, automatic detection of categorical
    variables, interactive control of interaction terms via an allowed matrix,
    comprehensive model diagnostics with variable importance and partial
    dependence plots, and publication-quality report generation via 'Quarto'.
